Package: admvn
Type: Package
Title: Multivariate Normal CDF and SUN Density with CppAD Derivatives
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person(given = "Patrick", family = "Brown",
    email = "patrick.brown@gmail.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: Evaluates the cumulative distribution function of the multivariate
    normal distribution using specialized bivariate/trivariate algorithms for
    dimension <= 3 and Genz quasi-Monte Carlo for higher dimensions, with
    gradient and Hessian with respect to the upper integration limits computed
    via CppAD automatic differentiation. Also provides the SUN(3,3) density
    with gradient and Hessian with respect to a block-Cholesky parameter vector.
License: GPL (>= 2)
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: Rcpp (>= 1.0.3), RCppAD
LinkingTo: Rcpp, RCppAD, RcppEigen, trustOptim
Suggests: mvtnorm, mnormt, numDeriv, sn, trustOptim, testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    knitr, rmarkdown
VignetteBuilder: knitr
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Encoding: UTF-8
SystemRequirements: OpenMP
RoxygenNote: 7.3.3
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
NeedsCompilation: yes
Collate:
    '000.R'
    'admvn-package.R'
    'RcppExports.R'
